OL,3,GNEWSAWoman who killed partner with air
OL,4,Arifle to continue treatment for PTSD
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman who killed her partner with an
OL,7,Fair rifle - and developed post
OL,8,Ftraumatic stress disorder as a result
OL,9,Fof the shooting - has been given a
OL,10,Fthree-year supervision and treatment
OL,11,Forder.
OL,13,FSimone Ramage, 41, fired a weapon at
OL,14,FBrian Kowbel at their home in
OL,15,FGalashiels on 17 February 2023.
OL,17,FThis was determined during an
OL,18,Fexamination of facts procedure, which
OL,19,Fis used when accused people are found
OL,20,Funfit to stand trial due to a mental
OL,21,Fdisorder.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,429,420,260,160,0,100
