OL,3,GNEWSAWoman who killed partner with air
OL,4,Arifle to continue treatment for PTSD
OL,5,
OL,6,FJudge John Morris KC told Ramage he was
OL,7,Fsatisfied the non-custodial sentence
OL,8,Fwas "the most suitable means of dealing
OL,9,Fwith you".
